OL,3,CLuis Enrique hopes Man City 'avoid'
OL,4,Closing their titles
OL,6,FParis St Germain boss has said he
OL,7,Fhopes Manchester City are not stripped
OL,8,Fof any titles.
OL,10,FLuis Enrique, whose side face City at
OL,11,Fthe Etihad Stadium in the Champions
OL,12,FLeague on October 14, does not want to
OL,13,Fsee the record books rewritten.
OL,15,FCity face severe punishments,
OL,16,Fincluding the possible removal of
OL,17,Fprevious wins, after being found
OL,18,Fguilty of multiple breaches of the
OL,19,FPremier League's financial regulations.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
