PN,36502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F365A1793447290
OL,3,CLuis Enrique hopes Man City 'avoid'
OL,4,Closing their titles
OL,6,FThe Spaniard said: "I hope everything
OL,7,Fworks out well for Man City because I
OL,8,Fthink what they have done on the pitch
OL,9,Fhas been incredible over the last few
OL,10,Fyears and they certainly deserved to
OL,11,Fwin all the trophies they have won.
OL,13,F"The trophies you win on the pitch
OL,14,Fremain on the pitch. They deserved to
OL,15,Fwin that and I hope they can avoid the
OL,16,Fsanction.
OL,18,F"But now we have to wait to see what
OL,19,Fthe authorities decide or the judge is
OL,20,Fgoing to say".
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
