PN,36503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F365A1793447290
OL,3,CLuis Enrique hopes Man City 'avoid'
OL,4,Closing their titles
OL,6,FEnrique may renew acquaintances with
OL,7,FPep Guardiola after Wednesday's game,
OL,8,Fas the former Manchester City managed
OL,9,Fis expected to make his first visit to
OL,10,Fthe Etihad Stadium since standing down
OL,11,Fin Summer 2025.
OL,13,FThe pair are friends and former
OL,14,FBarcelona teammates, and Enrique said:
OL,15,F"The things I will say to Pep I will
OL,16,Fdo in private".
OL,18,FWhile City have appealed against the
OL,19,Findependent commission's guilty
OL,20,Fverdict, they continue to look strong
OL,21,Fon the field.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
