OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,366,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F365A1793447290
OL,3,CLuis Enrique hopes Man City 'avoid'
OL,4,Closing their titles
OL,6,FEnzo Maresca's side are three points
OL,7,Fclear at the top of the Premier League
OL,8,Fafter Sunday's 3-0 triumph against
OL,9,FLiverpool.
OL,11,FEnrique said: "We are going to play as
OL,12,Fwe always do, attack all the time.
OL,14,F"Obviously there are some small
OL,15,Fdetails playing a team like Man City
OL,16,Fbut our mentality is always the same.
OL,18,F"We will try to attack all the time, a
OL,19,Fbit like Man City do. I used to watch
OL,20,FPep's Man City. I always watch Man
OL,21,FCity as a supporter.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,366,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F365A1793447290
OL,3,CLuis Enrique hopes Man City 'avoid'
OL,4,Closing their titles
OL,6,F"I like to watch Enzo Maresca's teams
OL,7,Fplay. They are very open, very
OL,8,Fattacking".
OL,10,FForward Ousmane Dembele dismissed a
OL,11,Fsuggestion it could be a good time to
OL,12,Fplay City.
OL,14,FHe said: "It is always difficult
OL,15,Fregardless of it being a good moment
OL,16,For a bad moment. They have a high
OL,17,Fquality team, world-class players and
OL,18,Fa top coach as well. It's always tough
OL,19,Fplaying Manchester City".
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/5
